--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,24 @@ Semantic Versioning.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- **Breaking:** `v1.Files.Add` now takes a file name and an `io.Reader` —
+  `Add(ctx, fileName, content, ...)` — and builds the multipart/form-data
+  body itself, matching `v1.CallLogs.AddRecording`. Callers no longer encode
+  the multipart body by hand. Association IDs previously embedded in that
+  body move to the new `WithFileDealID`, `WithFilePersonID`,
+  `WithFileOrganizationID`, `WithFileProductID`, `WithFileActivityID`,
+  `WithFileLeadID` and `WithFileProjectID` options.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- `v1.Files.Add` uploads are now retried after 429/5xx responses. The
+  multipart body is buffered before sending, so the request carries a
+  working `GetBody` and the retry transport can replay it; previously a
+  caller-supplied streaming body (e.g. an `*os.File`) was not replayable and
+  uploads failed immediately on the first 429.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
